.</span></h1><p class=\"hero-lead\" style=\"max-width:850px\">The final privacy policy must reflect the services, forms and data flows actually used.</p><div style=\"border-top:2px solid #e81848;padding:22px 0;margin-top:70px\"><strong style=\"color:#f5d367\">OUTSTANDING / PUBLICATION BLOCKED:</strong> Before publication, the operator and the person legally responsible must review and complete this information. This page is expressly not a valid legal document.</div><div class=\"step-list\"><div class=\"step\"><span class=\"step-number\">01</span><h3>Data controller</h3><p>The verified identity and contact details of the organisation responsible for processing personal data are required.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span class=\"step-number\">02</span><h3>Processing and legal bases</h3><p>Forms, hosting, server logs, email, embedded media, cookies and any analytics tools must each be documented individually.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span class=\"step-number\">03</span><h3>Recipients and retention periods</h3><p>Document processors, any transfers to third countries and retention periods based on the systems actually used.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span class=\"step-number\">04</span><h3>Data subject rights and contact</h3><p>Add complete, legally reviewed information about people's rights and how to exercise them. Do not guess these details from templates.</p></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:50px\"><a href=\"../kontakt/index.html\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Go to the contact page ↗</a></p></div></section></main><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"container footer-inner\"><div><strong>AROZ Webdesign Agentur.</strong><p>Bespoke web design, search engine optimisation and clear communication from Schwelm.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Legal information and contact\" class=\"footer-nav\"><a href=\"../kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"../impressum/index.html\">Legal Notice <span class=\"sr-note\">(Draft)</span></a><a href=\"index.html\">Privacy 